/*
 * One LINK instruction per variant. The whole instruction is replaced so the
 * four destination formats, the four-letter destination-component swizzle, the
 * export register and the optional (z) modifier all come from the manifest.
 *
 * The grammar assigns column k's format and the k-th swizzle letter to export
 * component k, so `LINK fp20, NOP, fp20, fx10.h, tram0.ywzx, export1` reads as
 * export.x -> tram.y as fp20, export.y skipped, export.z -> tram.z, export.w ->
 * tram.x's high fx10 half.
 */
@LINK@
